translate schinese_rewrite BadEnd_Bandit_Bondage_10c7e9af:

    bd3 "别骗人,你刚才想让我们 把你屁股还给你,现在你害怕了?"

translate schinese_rewrite BadEnd_Bandit_Bondage_a4ca0898:

